CHAPTER.VERS:
And he said to Moses, Come up to Yahweh, you, and Aaron, Nadab, and Abihu, and seventy of the elders of Israel; and you

          {+}
         worship far off:

And Moses took the blood, and sprinkled it on the people, and said, Here is the blood of the covenant, which Yahweh has made with you

          {+}
         concerning all these words.

And he said to the elders, You

          {+}
         tarry here for us, until we come again to you

          {+}
        : and, look, Aaron and Hur are with you

          {+}
        : whoever has a cause, let him come near to them.
